WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.809
Day 6. The Parts of Five.

2
00:00:02.259 --> 00:00:10.260
Watch first. Show it with real things. The first one on the page is done for you. Then do one together, and your child does the rest.

3
00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:14.873
Put five things in a row. Push three to one side, and two to the other.

4
00:00:15.373 --> 00:00:19.184
Say: three and two make five. Push them back together. Still five.

5
00:00:19.784 --> 00:00:23.193
Now four and one. Then let your child find one more way.

6
00:00:23.793 --> 00:00:27.324
Five and none is a way too. That one makes children laugh.

7
00:00:27.924 --> 00:00:33.225
On the page, each row is five split in two. Your child counts each part and writes it.
